<p><strong>Course:</strong> Biostat 655 – Analysis of Multilevel and Longitudinal Data<br>
<strong>Instructors:</strong> Dr.&nbsp;Zheyu Wang, Dr.&nbsp;Ji Soo Kim</p>
<hr>
